PREFIX px: <urn:pxai:semi:> CONSTRUCT { ?observation px:classifiesYieldLossMode px:yieldLossMode:systematic . } WHERE { ?observation a px:WaferMapSpatialPatternObservation . { ?observation px:patternCategoryCode ?pattern . FILTER(REGEX(LCASE(STR(?pattern)), "center|edge|ring|quadrant|reticle|field")) } UNION { ?observation px:signalText ?signal . FILTER(REGEX(LCASE(STR(?signal)), "center|edge|ring|quadrant|reticle|field|中心|边缘|环形|象限|视场")) } FILTER NOT EXISTS { ?observation px:classifiesYieldLossMode ?existingMode . } }
